{
  "title": "Oozing Resinous Filipino Pork Blood Dinuguan",
  "description": "A rich and savory Filipino pork blood stew made by simmering pork blood with pork offal, vegetables, and spices. Perfect for a sick day or a special occasion.",
  "cuisine": "Filipino",
